1
00:00:00,325 --> 00:00:01,575
(Leslie:)Boy, your heart's racing.

2
00:00:01,743 --> 00:00:04,163
I must have really gotten you going.

3
00:00:04,371 --> 00:00:05,661
(Howard:)Well, it's partly you.

4
00:00:05,831 --> 00:00:09,421
(Howard:)Partly my transient, idiopathic arrhythmia.

5
00:00:10,377 --> 00:00:12,207
(Leslie:)Sexy.

6
00:00:14,089 --> 00:00:17,799
(Howard:)Can I assume that
you've likewise found the experience...?

7
00:00:17,968 --> 00:00:19,888
(Leslie:)Satisfactory?

8
00:00:20,846 --> 00:00:23,056
(Howard:)That wasn't quite the word
I was looking for...

9
00:00:23,223 --> 00:00:25,393
(Howard:)...but sure, I'll do this pass-fail.

10
00:00:27,019 --> 00:00:29,729
(Leslie:)Hey, are you enjoying
that prototyper I got you?

11
00:00:29,897 --> 00:00:34,317
(Howard:)Oh, it's great. Everybody in the Engineering
Department is eating their hearts out.

12
00:00:34,485 --> 00:00:38,485
(Leslie:)Isn't it nice when your good fortune
makes others miserable?

13
00:00:40,073 --> 00:00:42,953
(Howard:)You know, most people don't get that.

14
00:00:43,952 --> 00:00:47,502
MRS. WOLOWITZ:
Howard, I'm home!

15
00:00:48,290 --> 00:00:51,040
- Oh, great.
MRS. WOLOWITZ: Book club was canceled.

